Runtime systems belong in `src/systems/main` and `src/systems/child`. Put reusable services in `src/services`, plugin definitions in `src/extensions`, and integrations in `src/pi`, `src/server`, and `src/web`. A core package's `src/web` is the browser contract it publishes to other packages, not a place for its own presentation: an extension package colocates browser code beside the routed file that renders it, in `_components` or `_lib`. Feature packages own their policies.
